The tea and bun maska are very tasty.
Now I want something sweet.
I look towards the counter.
There is a large glass jar there.
Inside the jar, there are small cakes.
I look for the waiter.
He is standing right nearby.
"Bhaiya, please listen," I call out.
He comes near my table.
"Yes madam, please tell me," he says.
"I want something sweet," I say.
"Is fresh mawa cake available?"
He smiles.
"Yes madam, completely fresh mawa cake is available," he says.
"Will you please give me one piece?" I ask.
"Yes, I will bring it right now," he replies.
"Thank you, bhaiya," I say.
He goes back towards the counter.
I happily wait for my cake.
